<h3><u>Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Isteghasa Hai ""Rehan Azmi"" Mera</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>Bargah-e-Aakhir-Uz-Zamaan(a.s.) Mein Aey Khuda</p>
<p>Lashkar-e-Imam(a.s.) Mein Hon Saaray Matmi</p>
<p>""Farhan"" Majlis-e-Hussain(a.s.) Mein Karay Dua</p>
<p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p>
<ol><li>Gharian Intezar Ki Tamam Ho Chukin </li><p>Zulm-o-Jor Ki Fizaen Aam Ho Chukin</p><p>Aap(a.s.) Kay Zahoor Ki Jo Thin Nishanian</p><p>Roonuma Woh Sab Har Aik Gaam Ho Chukin</p><p>Dair Ho Chuki Sahib-Uz-Zamaan(a.s.)</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>De Rahay Hain Kab Say Al-Ajal Ki Hum Sada</li><p>Bhaijtay Hain Har Baras Areezay Aur Dua</p><p>Mauj Ko Banalia Hai Apna Namah Bar</p><p>Jaanti Hai Mauj Hi To Aap(a.s.) Ka Pata</p><p>Aapp(a.s.) Kay Liey Hum Tarhaptay Hain</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Masjidein Pukarti Hain Har Namaz Mein </li><p>Bargahein Dhondti Hain Har Ghari Tumhain</p><p>Majlison Mein Parhtay Hain Dua-e-Nahia</p><p>Aarzoo Hai Is Sadi Mein Tum Ko Daikhlein</p><p>Daur Khatm Ho Ab Yeh Ghaib Ka</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Intezar-e-Adl Hai Adalaton Ko Bhi </li><p>Aap(a.s.) Aakhri Imam(a.s.) Barhwein(12th) Ali(a.s.)</p><p>Aap(a.s.) Aeay To Dil Ko Chain Aaeyga </p><p>Aap(a.s.) Hi Kay Intezar Mein Hai Zindagi</p><p>Taigh-e-Haidery(a.s.) Aap(a.s.) Laengay</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Hain Libas-e-Deen Mein Mukhalif-e-Aza</li><p>Baichnay Lagay Khateeb Zikr-e-Karbala</p><p>Para Para Kardia Hai Ittehad Ko</p><p>Majlison Say Hai Namaz Ka Muqabla</p><p>Waris(a.s.)-e-Aza Deer Na Laga</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Parhtay Hain Namaz Sheh(a.s.) Kay Saaray Matmi</li><p>Zikr Hai Namaz Ka To Majlison Mein Bhi</p><p>Sajda-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ka Jisay Khayal Hai</p><p>Janta Hai Manzilat Ko Woh Namaz Ki</p><p>Is Tafarraqay Ko Mitaeay</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Paash Paash Aap(a.s.) Ka Bhi Dil Hai Ya Imam(a.s.)</li><p>Yaad Aap(a.s.) Ko Bhi Hai Woh Karbala Ki Shaam</p><p>Jab Ridaen Bibion(s.a.) Kay Sar Say Chin Gaen</p><p>Jal Rahay Thay Jis Gharhi Hussain(a.s.) Kay Khayam</p><p>Pursa Lejiey Har Shaheed(a.s.) Ka</p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Ris Raha Hai Khoon Ab Bhi Jis Kay Kaan Say</li><p>Woh Sakina(s.a.) Qaid Say Na Aai Laut Kay</p><p>Qaid-e-Shaam Mein Lehad Hai Us(s.a.) Ki Aaj Bhi</p><p>Aati Hai Sada Yeh Aaj Us(s.a.) Ki Qabr Say</p><p>Zalimon Say Ab Intaqaam Lein </p><p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p><p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p><li>Intaqaam Shah(a.s.)-e-Karbala Ka Leingay Aap(a.s.)</li></ol>

<p>Majlison Mein Zikr-e-Karbala Kareingay Aap(a.s.)</p>
<p>Matam-e-Hussain(a.s.) Kay Urooj Kay Liey</p>
<p>Apnay Jad(a.s.) Kay Haal Ka Nauha Parhheingay Aap(a.s.)</p>
<p>Ghazi(a.s.) Ka Alam Hoga Haath Mein</p>
<p>Lashkar-e-Hussain(a.s.) Ban Kay Aeay Maula</p>
<p>(Aeay Maula Aeay Maula, Lashkar-e-Hussain Ban Kay Aeay Maula) x2</p></font></p>
